OL,3,AHarry leaves Nottingham with thumbs-up
OL,4,Aas he and Meghan round out first joint
OL,5,Avisit since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex were met
OL,8,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,9,Fas they toured Nottingham on their
OL,10,Ffirst royal-style joint engagement
OL,11,Fsince returning to the UK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan just visited youth
OL,14,Fcharity Epic Partners, the third and
OL,15,Ffinal stop on their visit. Outside was
OL,16,FRafi Rashad, 20, a student from
OL,17,FIndonesia who is studying in the UK: "I
OL,18,Fsaw them holding hands with each other
OL,19,Fwhich was very nice."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
