OL,3,AHarry leaves Nottingham with thumbs-up
OL,4,Aas he and Meghan round out first joint
OL,5,Avisit since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FHarry shot our social affairs
OL,8,Fcorrespondent a thumbs-up and a smile
OL,9,Fwhen asked by the BBC about his love
OL,10,Ffor Nottingham
OL,12,FEarlier, they took part in a cooking
OL,13,Fclass at Himmah, an organisation
OL,14,Ftackling food poverty. The Duke and
OL,15,FDuchess had an emotional reunion with
OL,16,Ftheir Grenfell "ladies", who Meghan
OL,17,Fworked with on a cookbook in 2018
OL,19,FTheir first stop was the Community
OL,20,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,21,FHarry has a long relationship with
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
